# All values are OPTIONAL. A build with no .env at all gets the full cloud
# experience: Supabase access routes through the sei proxy
# (https://api.sei.gg/supabase), which injects the public anon key
# server-side. Local (BYOK) mode never needed any of these.

# Override the proxy host (e.g. a locally running sei-proxy).
#SEI_PROXY_URL=

# Direct-to-Supabase override for self-hosters running their own Supabase
# project. Set BOTH or NEITHER — a URL with no key sends an unusable
# placeholder key to your project. The anon key is public-by-design;
# RLS is the actual security boundary.
#SUPABASE_URL=
#SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Voice calls (dev only) ---
# OPTIONAL: an ElevenLabs API key for exercising voice calls WITHOUT a deployed
# proxy — when set, the main process talks to ElevenLabs directly instead of
# routing through the proxy's /tts/speech. Dev shells only; production clients
# must never ship a key (the proxy holds it). Never commit a real key.
# SEI_TTS_DEV_KEY=

# --- PostHog product analytics ---
# OPTIONAL. Official builds bake the public phc_ project key into
# src/main/analytics.ts, so analytics works with no .env. The phc_ key is
# write-only (ingest, never read) and safe to ship. Set these only to point a
# build at a different PostHog project/host, or set POSTHOG_KEY= (empty) to
# disable analytics entirely in a from-source build.
#POSTHOG_KEY=
# Default https://us.i.posthog.com (US cloud).
#POSTHOG_HOST=

# --- Backseat salience gate (PARKED, dev only) ---
# Nothing reads these today. The small VLM that decided whether six seconds of
# gameplay were worth commenting on was replaced by the idle schedule in 260801,
# because measured against real clips it said yes to almost everything.
# salienceGate.ts is kept in-tree, unreferenced, and these knobs are kept with
# it so bringing it back is a one-import change rather than an excavation. If it
# ever does come back: this is a real DeepInfra secret, production is meant to
# route it through the proxy the way TTS does, and it must never ship in a
# packaged build. Never commit a real key.
#SEI_GATE_DEV_KEY=
# Override the gate model (default Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct, chosen by
# measurement: gemma-3-4b says yes to everything, gemma-3-12b says no to
# everything, 30B-A3B is the only one on DeepInfra that discriminates).
#SEI_GATE_MODEL=
